# Data (local engine state and exports). As of 2026-10-09, CI no longer commits lead CSVs
# or outreach ledgers into leads/ - the Supabase DB is authoritative and CI uploads CSVs as
# 90-day artifacts. leads/ stays gitignored belt-and-braces so a future accidental commit of
# PII can't happen even if someone re-adds the step.
data/*
!data/**/.gitkeep
leads/
stress_*.log
stress_*.stdout

